LavenderTown_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_RocketsDoAnythingForMoney::
    .string "Team Rocket will\n"
    .string "do anything for money.\p"
    .string "No deed too\n"
    .string "heinous.\n"
    .string "No crime too wicked.\p"
    .string "They went into\n"
    .string "the Tower for\n"
    .string "money.\p"
    .string "They came out\n"
    .string "talking about four names.\p"
    .string "Then they stopped\n"
    .string "talking entirely.$"

LavenderTown_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_CubonesMotherKilledByRockets::
    .string "I saw Cubone's\n"
    .string "mother trying to\n"
    .string "escape Team Rocket.\p"
    .string "She was killed\n"
    .string "trying to get away.\p"
    .string "The Tower ghosts\n"
    .string "say her name\n"
    .string "too.\p"
    .string "And four others\n"
    .string "that aren't Pokemon.$"

LavenderTown_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_PeoplePayForCuboneSkulls::
    .string "Cubone wears skulls.\n"
    .string "People pay for one.\p"
    .string "The ghosts in\n"
    .string "the Tower don't\n"
    .string "wear anything.\p"
    .string "They just repeat\n"
    .string "four names.\p"
    .string "ProtoGlyph is one.\p"
    .string "I heard it clearly.$"

